--- /dev/null
+++ b/LOCAL_PATCH.md
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+# Local coupled-wheel correction
+Exact upstream ros2_controllers 4.40.1 with attribution retained. Optional
+coupled_wheel_velocity_limit defaults to zero (legacy behavior). With a positive
+cap and jerk disabled, project the requested endpoint after axis speed bounds,
+use existing native axis rate allowances, then share their minimum progress.
+Store and publish that emitted result before wheel conversion. Invalid state
+emits zero. Wheel cap is configuration-only. No lease/watchdog/clock change.
